*|DSPF 1.0
*|DESIGN "inv"
*|DIVIDER /
*|DELIMITER :
*|BUSBIT []
*|GROUND_NET VSS
.SUBCKT inv A Y VDD VSS
*|NET A 1.2e-15
*|P (A I 0 0 0)
*|I (MN1:G MN1 G I 1e-16 0 0)
*|I (MP1:G MP1 G I 1e-16 0 0)
*|S (A:1 0 0)
R1 A A:1 10
R2 A:1 MN1:G 5
R3 A:1 MP1:G 5
C1 A:1 VSS 1e-16
C2 MN1:G VSS 2e-16
*|NET Y 8e-16
*|P (Y O 0 0 0)
*|I (MN1:D MN1 D B 0 0 0)
*|I (MP1:D MP1 D B 0 0 0)
R4 MN1:D Y 20
R5 MP1:D Y 20
C3 Y VSS 5e-16
*
* Instance Section
*
MN1 MN1:D MN1:G VSS VSS nch W=1u L=0.1u
MP1 MP1:D MP1:G VDD VDD pch W=2u L=0.1u
.ENDS
